<description>&lt;p&gt;Ecuador authorities have summoned seven people to stand trial for plotting to murder a political candidate, indicating ongoing organized-crime violence. U.S. prosecutors have charged the son of former President and four others with cocaine trafficking, linking Ecuadorian actors to international drug routes. A priest was killed when a crucifix fell from a church wall in the Galapagos, adding a fatal incident to the security crisis. The conflict, which began in 2018, recorded two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Patch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQUHczLURZd0tVNmk0WGFNVmlzaEk1WGtzSW1SVk5fbXM1dndBalZzOXJLZEdRN2o4clBHTEdqVmZvUFZ0d2hibEJZaDVtZzNVMGZkVm9tSy0wWmd1ZVBWRktSMFc5TGFWejZsMWxXUDhmMDVGOHhEM0RtZjZMcjZJbjV5bldjeDhIdlRLX09yeWZHQTU2bzliMDRB?oc=5&quot;&gt;News-Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQQ0k5c3hKQzFKNzkwZWFyTUNvaGtieTFibWZsVzJPN0t1VnVZd21PdVN5czVDbkJTTnFhSTh0TWVrdDlBRzZEeWM0dzdiM2J5bVMzUDBmUllCUnIwQm1raS1mSGcxc2c0dHIwc1VQV0VMcFVfbXF6X2d6cW9ySWIyVFpFRGFlMmZieXRjQzJSaU1xZk02eG5yM1VGRUxOQl9yV0xuNGU4TEcxNUtublBPaVlHS1FvUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Goodreturns&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNYkVpem9sWVpPTE1faWI3T0NBMU5ic0M2QjVhWS1FcGVxc0l2UzF0LUhUdmhwVlBMZGlaWGZ0QUJwNVQ4SklQOTRfR0hTdkhrVzdqQlptQzY1WUgzMXp6bkJlZ0Q5Z1JPN292NS03blJmZkZUOFJjSVRqM2tpcGRlQ0RQZXg5bE1naTZnUENSZHo3YkdWV0kyRFp3bVgyOTZnaG1PbTRDbGxiUmxOUVMxaDIxU0JHZkVGVmtQQUNR?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSLS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Devdiscourse&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
